1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,600
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,000
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,343 --> 00:00:17,920
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,503 --> 00:00:22,240
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,637 --> 00:00:28,640
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:30,200
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,493 --> 00:00:35,284
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,135 --> 00:00:39,660
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:44,320
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,957 --> 00:00:48,777
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,303 --> 00:00:53,060
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,750 --> 00:00:58,177
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,233 --> 00:01:02,200
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,533 --> 00:01:08,770
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,226 --> 00:01:15,600
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,773 --> 00:01:19,120
(1994)

17
00:01:20,113 --> 00:01:23,045
(Nanhu Gang, Hutou Jun)

18
00:01:23,079 --> 00:01:23,920
Ling Che.

19
00:01:25,079 --> 00:01:26,000
You made me miss.

20
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:29,120
Last time you used my route
to smuggle those Mercedes S-Class.

21
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:31,200
And you hurt so many of my men.

22
00:01:31,799 --> 00:01:32,599
How are you going to make this right?

23
00:01:33,319 --> 00:01:34,159
What do you want?

24
00:01:34,719 --> 00:01:36,000
From now on,

25
00:01:36,519 --> 00:01:38,280
this street belongs to me.

26
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:40,560
Get lost now,

27
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,040
and I'll let you walk away.

28
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,680
This is Boss Hui's territory.

29
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:46,000
You don't get to decide that.

30
00:01:46,599 --> 00:01:47,319
Idiot.

31
00:01:48,959 --> 00:01:50,200
Take them all out.

32
00:01:50,439 --> 00:01:51,200
Leave no one alive.

33
00:01:58,319 --> 00:01:59,280
I bought this for Boss Che.

34
00:02:00,599 --> 00:02:02,079
I want one too.

35
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:03,799
Once I start working for Boss Che,

36
00:02:04,439 --> 00:02:05,519
I'll make big money.

37
00:02:05,719 --> 00:02:08,000
Then I'll buy you all the good food.

38
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,520
Anything you want.

39
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:10,800
Okay, okay.

40
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,199
Come on, get down. Stay low.

41
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:28,840
Come on, come on.

42
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,680
Hold this.

43
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:31,719
Raise it.

44
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:33,639
Wave it.

45
00:02:34,199 --> 00:02:34,599
Wave it.

46
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:36,400
That's it.

47
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:39,599
Everyone inside, listen up.

48
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:42,280
You're surrounded by the police.

49
00:02:43,199 --> 00:02:43,840
Stop!

50
00:02:43,919 --> 00:02:45,240
Drop your weapons and surrender.

51
00:02:45,439 --> 00:02:46,680
You are actually a police informant?

52
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:48,039
You'll never make it if you do that.

53
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:48,879
Let's go.

54
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:55,520
Boss Che.

55
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,400
Boss Che, it's me.

56
00:02:58,759 --> 00:02:59,280
Take it.

57
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:03,120
Boss Che.

58
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:08,199
Boss Che.

59
00:03:09,759 --> 00:03:10,439
I want to follow you.

60
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:15,120
I may not be good at fighting,

61
00:03:15,639 --> 00:03:16,400
but look,

62
00:03:17,719 --> 00:03:18,759
I'm still useful.

63
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,159
Right?

64
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:24,520
Boss Che.

65
00:03:27,199 --> 00:03:27,960
Stop messing around.

66
00:03:33,039 --> 00:03:33,560
Boss Che.

67
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,719
Come on, say "Boss Che."

68
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:49,960
Boss Che.

69
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:53,960
Was that fun?

70
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,240
Yeah.

71
00:03:56,623 --> 00:03:59,430
(Loyalty Hall)

72
00:04:01,122 --> 00:04:01,769
(Disciple Application)

73
00:04:01,808 --> 00:04:03,228
♪May the Guardian protect us♪

74
00:04:03,262 --> 00:04:05,182
(Disciple, Shen Yanlin)

75
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,560
Starting today,

76
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:11,360
you work for me.

77
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:14,120
The Gang has Thirty-Six Oaths.

78
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:16,000
It's fine
if you can't remember them all.

79
00:04:16,959 --> 00:04:18,120
Just remember one thing.

80
00:04:19,639 --> 00:04:20,680
Betray your brothers,

81
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:23,000
and you'll die by a thousand blades.

82
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:41,319
Those with loyalty cross the bridge.

83
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:43,959
Those without it die by the blade.

84
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:45,839
Pay your respects.

85
00:04:46,146 --> 00:04:46,872
(Loyalty Hall)

86
00:04:46,926 --> 00:04:48,780
♪Together in life and death,
one heart as one♪

87
00:04:49,052 --> 00:04:50,453
♪May the Guardian protect us♪

88
00:04:52,792 --> 00:04:54,466
♪May the Guardian protect us♪

89
00:04:55,188 --> 00:04:56,748
♪May the Guardian protect us♪

90
00:04:58,888 --> 00:05:00,855
♪Together in life and death,
one heart as one♪

91
00:05:00,915 --> 00:05:02,500
♪May the Guardian protect us♪

92
00:05:10,977 --> 00:05:13,837
=Episode 3=

93
00:05:14,077 --> 00:05:15,784
(1999)

94
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:19,439
The primer marks are shallow.

95
00:05:20,439 --> 00:05:21,439
The casing has a coating.

96
00:05:23,839 --> 00:05:25,040
Same batch from the same gunsmith.

97
00:05:25,879 --> 00:05:26,720
The goods themselves are fine.

98
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:28,120
But...

99
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:30,399
whether they're clean is another story.

100
00:05:31,079 --> 00:05:31,920
What do you mean?

101
00:05:32,079 --> 00:05:32,680
Bro.

102
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,839
Several cops were killed recently,

103
00:05:34,839 --> 00:05:36,040
and they were killed
with the same batch.

104
00:05:36,879 --> 00:05:37,639
You're framing us.

105
00:05:47,959 --> 00:05:49,839
I only delivered the goods
and took the money.

106
00:05:50,639 --> 00:05:51,519
I swear I don't know anything else.

107
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:53,040
Who did you deliver them to?

108
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,360
Hutou Jun from Nanhu Gang.

109
00:05:58,399 --> 00:05:59,199
Don't shoot, please.

110
00:06:00,519 --> 00:06:00,879
Get lost.

111
00:06:07,879 --> 00:06:09,959
Hutou Jun stole our shipment.

112
00:06:11,279 --> 00:06:12,759
Ever since Boss Hai rose
to power these past two years,

113
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:15,199
Nanhu Gang has been much weaker.

114
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:17,839
For Hutou Jun to make this move,

115
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:19,920
he must have something in mind.

116
00:06:20,319 --> 00:06:21,120
There are only

117
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,079
two possible reasons.

118
00:06:24,079 --> 00:06:24,519
First,

119
00:06:25,199 --> 00:06:26,120
he's connected to Boss Hai's death.

120
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:29,199
He wants to distract us
by stealing the shipment

121
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,000
so we stop investigating
Boss Hai's death.

122
00:06:31,639 --> 00:06:32,160
Second,

123
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,959
he wants to take our territory
while we're distracted.

124
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,759
But Hutou Jun would never admit it.

125
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:38,689
I heard he built his empire

126
00:06:38,690 --> 00:06:40,240
not through that skating rink

127
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,639
or that arcade.

128
00:06:43,839 --> 00:06:46,079
He made his fortune
from those gambling machines.

129
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:47,399
So you're saying...

130
00:06:55,156 --> 00:06:56,237
(Golden Grand Slam)

131
00:06:58,895 --> 00:07:00,108
(One bet changes the game.
One round decides the fate.)

132
00:07:11,319 --> 00:07:12,279
(Hutou Jun's guys)

133
00:07:12,279 --> 00:07:13,879
(don't know you.)

134
00:07:14,279 --> 00:07:15,199
(Use that to get inside.)

135
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:45,759
Lately,

136
00:07:46,079 --> 00:07:47,360
Hui's temper

137
00:07:47,759 --> 00:07:48,360
has been out of control.

138
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:51,079
All this chaos just to investigate

139
00:07:51,759 --> 00:07:53,959
Boss Hai's death.

140
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,279
The position of shot-caller

141
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,240
is something everyone wants.

142
00:07:58,800 --> 00:07:59,680
The harder they investigate,

143
00:08:00,439 --> 00:08:01,800
the more they prove their innocence.

144
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:02,759
What if

145
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:04,800
what happened to Boss Hai

146
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:08,759
wasn't done by an outsider at all?

147
00:08:18,319 --> 00:08:18,920
Got one.

148
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:20,680
Lucky catch!

149
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:27,879
Easy, easy.

150
00:08:30,399 --> 00:08:32,720
This is Boss Jun's newest demo machine.

151
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:33,840
Bro.

152
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:35,600
This thing

153
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:37,279
is incredible!

154
00:08:37,759 --> 00:08:39,240
It came from the Middle East.

155
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,960
The payout rate is amazing.

156
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:45,200
If we fill this whole place
with these machines,

157
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:46,720
it'll be packed.

158
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,159
Obviously.

159
00:08:48,759 --> 00:08:50,639
Boss Jun already ordered another batch.

160
00:08:51,519 --> 00:08:53,600
We're just waiting for delivery.

161
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:56,080
But I heard

162
00:08:57,799 --> 00:08:58,840
things have been tight lately.

163
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,240
Might be hard to pull off.

164
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:02,559
That's not your concern.

165
00:09:03,159 --> 00:09:05,000
Just do your job.

166
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:07,840
You won't lose your cut.

167
00:09:11,399 --> 00:09:11,879
Bro.

168
00:09:13,799 --> 00:09:14,879
Thanks for looking out for me.

169
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,159
When we're done today,

170
00:09:17,799 --> 00:09:19,159
drinks are on me.

171
00:09:19,759 --> 00:09:20,960
I'll get girls for everyone too.

172
00:09:21,159 --> 00:09:22,240
Now that's more like it.

173
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:23,919
Come on, hurry up.

174
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:24,639
Hold it properly.

175
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,519
I'll check this side.

176
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:35,840
What's this?

177
00:09:38,159 --> 00:09:39,399
Hutou Jun's arcade.

178
00:09:39,799 --> 00:09:41,320
He bought a new batch
of arcade machines.

179
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:43,480
They're going through Sai Kung.

180
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:45,879
They're trying to take over
our transport route.

181
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,120
Bro.

182
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:49,639
A toy for you.

183
00:09:52,399 --> 00:09:53,279
Got it.

184
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:57,159
Nice.

185
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,600
Those gambling machines weren't cheap.

186
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,080
Where did he get the money?

187
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:06,440
He paid for them with jewelry.

188
00:10:10,879 --> 00:10:13,600
The time and location of every shipment

189
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:14,480
are different every time.

190
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:14,960
Besides,

191
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:16,240
for security reasons,

192
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:18,119
I only assign the manpower

193
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:18,919
two hours beforehand.

194
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,639
How could he know everything?

195
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:23,960
There has to be an insider.

196
00:10:24,519 --> 00:10:25,480
There's no other explanation.

197
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:28,840
But Tidao, Huogun, Dazui...

198
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:30,639
they've been with us the whole time.

199
00:10:31,519 --> 00:10:32,639
If they're the mole,

200
00:10:34,159 --> 00:10:35,440
I'd rather not know.

201
00:10:39,399 --> 00:10:41,120
The people who know every detail
of our shipments

202
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:43,639
include me.

203
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:49,039
Then it has to be you.

204
00:10:52,799 --> 00:10:54,000
The guys at the arcade

205
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:54,919
did mention

206
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:57,039
Hutou Jun had a grudge against Boss Hai.

207
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:58,360
He wanted him dead.

208
00:10:59,639 --> 00:11:00,600
If Nanhu Gang really did it

209
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,840
and planned Boss Hai's murder,

210
00:11:02,399 --> 00:11:03,879
we can use the insider

211
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:06,200
to find evidence linking Nanhu Gang
to his death.

212
00:11:12,759 --> 00:11:13,519
Hello? What's up?

213
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:15,720
(Dongshan Tai went to see Boss Hui.)

214
00:11:17,887 --> 00:11:18,607
Okay.

215
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:29,360
Boss Hui.

216
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:29,960
Boss Hui.

217
00:11:29,997 --> 00:11:31,237
(Dongcheng Tiger)

218
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:31,919
What?

219
00:11:33,919 --> 00:11:34,799
You bought a knife to cut fruit?

220
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:36,279
Put it away.

221
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:42,840
(Dongcheng Tiger)

222
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:43,240
Boss Hui.

223
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:44,879
You were right.

224
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:46,279
Mr. Six's matter

225
00:11:46,799 --> 00:11:47,759
is easy enough to handle.

226
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:49,840
But Boss Ji and Mr. Nine's

227
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:51,159
businesses

228
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:53,039
were hit too.

229
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:54,799
And those places

230
00:11:55,879 --> 00:11:57,000
also have your investments.

231
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:59,639
As for Boss Ji and Mr. Nine,

232
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:03,080
I don't need you telling me how
to handle it.

233
00:12:05,230 --> 00:12:06,963
(Loyalty)

234
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:07,480
Boss Hui.

235
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:12,120
It's obvious Nanhu Gang is behind this.

236
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:14,799
I've found some leads.

237
00:12:15,799 --> 00:12:16,840
Boss Hai's death

238
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:20,120
is likely connected to Nanhu Gang
as well.

239
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:21,759
(Dongcheng Tiger)

240
00:12:21,759 --> 00:12:23,519
(Loyalty)
We're all working for the organization.

241
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:25,799
We can't let Nanhu Gang

242
00:12:26,559 --> 00:12:27,440
take advantage of this.

243
00:12:30,799 --> 00:12:31,240
Boss Hui.

244
00:12:32,799 --> 00:12:33,919
We can work together.

245
00:12:37,879 --> 00:12:39,039
Yong's vote

246
00:12:40,039 --> 00:12:41,000
is as good as mine.

247
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,240
But you and I

248
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:46,799
will never work together.

249
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:53,639
I'll take my leave.

250
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:59,440
(Dongcheng Tiger)

251
00:13:03,639 --> 00:13:04,759
(Dongcheng Tiger)
What are you doing?

252
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:08,759
Boss Tai.

253
00:13:09,320 --> 00:13:10,919
Shuangdao Hui looks down on everyone.

254
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:12,440
Why bother going to him?

255
00:13:13,159 --> 00:13:13,559
Bao Zun.

256
00:13:14,399 --> 00:13:15,440
You've been with me for so long,

257
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:16,919
yet you're still so hot-headed.

258
00:13:17,679 --> 00:13:18,360
You know what?

259
00:13:18,559 --> 00:13:20,039
The key isn't

260
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:22,000
who avenges Boss Hai.

261
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:24,399
Nor is it about Yong's vote.

262
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:26,200
The real point is

263
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:28,759
the word "revenge".

264
00:13:32,159 --> 00:13:34,080
Any news from Hutou Jun's side?

265
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,679
The news of Boss Hai's death is out.

266
00:13:39,159 --> 00:13:40,519
He postponed the casino opening.

267
00:13:48,159 --> 00:13:48,799
Boss Jun.

268
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:50,960
Everything's been taken care of.

269
00:13:51,799 --> 00:13:52,360
But...

270
00:13:52,559 --> 00:13:53,519
But what?

271
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:55,440
Want me to guess?

272
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:58,039
Shuangdao Hui's people
are investigating the fish farm.

273
00:13:58,639 --> 00:13:59,440
Let him investigate.

274
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:05,799
I'm sorry, Boss Jun.

275
00:14:05,799 --> 00:14:06,840
It's okay.

276
00:14:07,159 --> 00:14:07,879
It's nothing.

277
00:14:08,399 --> 00:14:08,919
Come here.

278
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,159
You see,

279
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:14,320
I really like beautiful women.

280
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:22,080
Why would I make things difficult
for you?

281
00:14:23,039 --> 00:14:24,360
But there's one thing about me...

282
00:14:25,039 --> 00:14:27,879
I hate hearing people apologize to me.

283
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:31,039
I'm the only one who gets to say sorry.

284
00:14:49,440 --> 00:14:49,960
(Demolition)

285
00:14:56,879 --> 00:14:58,000
Right on time.

286
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:02,879
Qin Hai is dead.

287
00:15:03,919 --> 00:15:05,000
Dongcheng Gang is going into chaos.

288
00:15:05,639 --> 00:15:07,131
Many of our previous leads

289
00:15:07,132 --> 00:15:07,960
have been cut off.

290
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:08,720
Chaos

291
00:15:08,879 --> 00:15:10,879
is definitely a risk for us.

292
00:15:11,600 --> 00:15:13,000
But it's also a great opportunity.

293
00:15:15,320 --> 00:15:15,759
So,

294
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,840
your top priority now

295
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:20,519
is to find Qin Hai's real killer.

296
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,399
Only by finding the killer

297
00:15:22,919 --> 00:15:24,000
can we uncover

298
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:25,600
Dongcheng Gang's deepest secrets.

299
00:15:26,639 --> 00:15:27,000
Yes.

300
00:15:27,879 --> 00:15:28,360
Here.

301
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:29,879
This.

302
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:31,919
It's for you.

303
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:33,519
For me?

304
00:15:34,559 --> 00:15:35,759
Five years ago today,

305
00:15:36,039 --> 00:15:37,399
you accepted the undercover assignment.

306
00:15:38,159 --> 00:15:40,200
This is a five-year anniversary gift.

307
00:15:40,559 --> 00:15:41,639
The first time
you've ever given me a gift.

308
00:15:43,210 --> 00:15:45,341
(Gift from Xinlong Supermarket)

309
00:15:45,919 --> 00:15:47,120
No way, Officer Luo.

310
00:15:48,679 --> 00:15:50,120
A fifth-anniversary gift
from a supermarket?

311
00:15:50,799 --> 00:15:51,600
It's fine.

312
00:15:51,919 --> 00:15:53,159
It's actually very useful.

313
00:15:53,519 --> 00:15:55,279
I use it all the time.

314
00:15:55,519 --> 00:15:56,080
It's fine. Really.

315
00:15:57,024 --> 00:15:58,917
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant)

316
00:16:00,639 --> 00:16:01,759
Did you find out who the mole is?

317
00:16:07,039 --> 00:16:07,840
Look at this first.

318
00:16:10,890 --> 00:16:12,320
(Shicheng Xingfa Bank Transaction
Record Account Holder: Liu Huogun)

319
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:15,080
What is this?

320
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:16,879
Just look at the numbers.

321
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:19,679
I've checked every one of our guys.

322
00:16:20,039 --> 00:16:21,399
These are Huogun's account transactions.

323
00:16:25,799 --> 00:16:26,519
Explain yourself.

324
00:16:27,679 --> 00:16:28,440
What's going on?

325
00:16:43,297 --> 00:16:46,440
♪Live by the blade, die by the blade♪

326
00:16:49,657 --> 00:16:52,780
♪Ride the waves and you may drown
in them♪

327
00:16:55,257 --> 00:16:58,344
♪If you gamble your life, go all in♪

328
00:16:58,450 --> 00:17:02,400
♪Leave it to fate. Take it if you dare♪

329
00:17:09,016 --> 00:17:11,715
♪They say every brother has his price♪

330
00:17:11,761 --> 00:17:15,000
♪They say this world swallows you whole♪

331
00:17:15,708 --> 00:17:18,280
♪I won this life on a roll of the dice♪

332
00:17:18,308 --> 00:17:21,420
♪I staked my soul to set myself free♪

333
00:17:21,901 --> 00:17:25,820
♪I was born too tough to break♪

334
00:17:28,916 --> 00:17:32,480
♪Tough enough to walk this road to ruin♪

335
00:17:35,083 --> 00:17:39,740
♪This is my fate. I won't fight it♪

336
00:17:41,803 --> 00:17:45,016
♪I'd rather call my own shots♪

337
00:17:48,763 --> 00:17:51,146
♪Incense fades,
but the ashes still burn♪

338
00:17:51,232 --> 00:17:54,220
♪Every prayer at the altar rings hollow♪

339
00:17:55,178 --> 00:17:57,720
♪On this long road, never bow your head♪

340
00:17:57,798 --> 00:18:01,040
♪On this road, there's no turning back♪

341
00:18:01,571 --> 00:18:04,480
♪The faces onstage keep changing♪

342
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:07,893
♪While blood below keeps pooling♪
